and I could never imagine.

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:52.350
It was insanity. And they
totally crushed Saddam.

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.140
Within a few weeks, they
had pushed Saddam back

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:59.520
and completely won over
the hearts of the royals.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:01.497
The bromance is back in business.

00:20:01.497 --> 00:20:02.330
(subdued music)

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.720
So, now you have these Saudis

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.520
that are beaming at the Americans

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.710
for helping them fight off Saddam.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:09.930
And you have a bunch of
bases that the U.S. set up

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.060
to mount this attack.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.680
Way more than before.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:17.490
The U.S. came with all of
this firepower and manpower

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:19.380
and bases and artillery.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.390
And then they just sort of never left.

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:24.960
Something that really
pissed off a lot of Saudis,

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.940
who were very uncomfortable

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.890
with U.S. presence to begin with.

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:30.930
But the guy who was most pissed off

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.360
than anyone in the Middle
East at this point?

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:35.010
Osama bin Laden,

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:38.400
who had not only been
rejected by his own country,

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.530
but then who got chosen instead,

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:43.410
but the great Satan, the United States,

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.820
a power that Osama

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:48.060
had built his entire
life fighting against.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:50.490
So, Osama bin Laden starts to double down

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:51.960
on his original mission.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.550
He leaves Saudi Arabia

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:57.780
and begins coordinating
very precise attacks

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.510
that could really only
be coordinated by a guy

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:03.900
who was good at technical
details of a construction company

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.820
and who had lots of money to fund it.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.040
He carries out attacks
against the United States

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.960
all around the world.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:13.590
And by the late '90s, he
starts planning the attack

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:15.417
that would change our world forever.

00:21:15.417 --> 00:21:19.705
(siren wailing)
(radios chatter)

00:21:19.705 --> 00:21:22.288
