00:21:23.311 --> 00:21:25.140
(soft dramatic music)

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:28.320
- So, this is just the
first half of the story.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.940
What happens next

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:32.597
