all kind of familiar with.

00:21:32.597 --> 00:21:35.666
(fanatics chant)

00:21:35.666 --> 00:21:37.620
(gunshots chatter)

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:39.930
In fact, I think we're all
still kind of processing

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:42.540
the U.S. presence in the Middle East today

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.160
and how that all went down.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:45.930
But it deserves taking a look at,

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:47.640
and I'm not going to do that right now.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:51.270
I want to make a separate
video for Iraq and Afghanistan

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:52.890
